    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectInReach? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\tDO ProcessObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObstacleInFront? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO AvoidObstacle\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO MoveForward\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
